#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:9420 8ef112d70a5845dea4faaf19347b658b
msgid ""
"选择 `DeepMD NPY` 时，再选择子目录按 `Config_type` 还是按化学式分组。选择 Mixed 时显示“虚拟原子填充”：`0` "
"按精确原子数分组，正整数按 dpdata 的 `atom_numb_pad` 规则向上补齐，使不同原子数可进入同一目录。XYZ 不显示这两个选项。"
msgstr ""
"When `DeepMD NPY` is selected, choose whether subdirectories are grouped by "
"`Config_type` or by chemical formula. With Mixed, `Virtual-atom padding` is shown: "
"`0` groups by exact atom count, while a positive integer rounds counts up according "
"to dpdata's `atom_numb_pad` rule so systems with different atom counts can share a "
"directory. These two options are not shown for XYZ."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:9421 dfd7d8dd5f6d410b929d5f13287b9156
